  - cn: "\u83B1\u6587\u8F6C\u5934\u770B\u7740\u7BDD\u706B\uFF0C\u706B\u7130\u7684\u5149\u8F89\u6295\u5C04\u5728\u4ED6\u7684\u8138\u4E0A\u3002"
    en: Levine turns his head and looks at the campfire. The light of the flames
      falls across his face.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 1
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 4
    expression: 4
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 7
    minigameType: 0
  - cn: "\u4ED6\u7684\u5934\u53D1\u5782\u843D\u5728\u8138\u4FA7\uFF0C\u8BA9\u4F60\u65E0\u6CD5\u770B\u6E05\u4ED6\u7684\u8868\u60C5\u3002"
    en: His hair hangs beside his face, making it impossible for you to see his expression
      clearly.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 1
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 4
    expression: 4
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 7
    minigameType: 0
  - cn: "\u201C\u95EE\u9898\u5E76\u4E0D\u51FA\u5728\u7ED3\u679C\u4E0A\u3002\u201D\u83B1\u6587\u8FD9\u6837\u8BF4\u7740\uFF0C\u4F60\u89C9\u5F97\u4ED6\u7684\u8BED\u6C14\u4F3C\u4E4E\u548C\u5E73\u65F6\u5F88\u4E0D\u4E00\u6837\u3002"
    en: '"The problem is not the result," Levine says. His tone seems very different
      from usual.'
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 1
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 4
    expression: 4
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 7
    minigameType: 0
  - cn: "\u4F60\u540C\u6837\u77E5\u9053\u8FD9\u4E0D\u5BF9\u52B2\uFF0C\u4F46\u6CA1\u6709\u4EBA\u80FD\u89E3\u51B3\u8FD9\u4E2A\u95EE\u9898\u3002"
    en: You also know this is wrong, but no one can solve the problem.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 1
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 4
    expression: 4
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 7
    minigameType: 0
  - cn: "\u4F60\u6C89\u9ED8\u4E86\u8BB8\u4E45\u3002"
    en: You are silent for a long time.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
    enHaveBranch: 0
    enBranch: []
    isPlayerTalking: 0
    isAside: 1
    codes: 
    onlyCode: 0
    speaker: 4
    expression: 4
    showCg: 0
    cgNum: 7
    minigameType: 0
  - cn: "\u8FD8\u6CA1\u7B49\u4F60\u60F3\u597D\u600E\u4E48\u56DE\u7B54\uFF0C\u83B1\u6587\u4EFF\u4F5B\u53C8\u56DE\u5230\u539F\u6765\u7684\u6837\u5B50\uFF0C\u6D3B\u8DC3\u6C14\u6C1B\u822C\u7684\u7B11\u4E86\u7B11\u3002"
    en: Before you can think of how to answer, Levine seems to return to his old
      self again and smiles as if trying to lighten the mood.
    cnHaveBranch: 0
    cnBranch: []
